      "outcome": "policy_amendment",
      "tier": 3,
      "detail": "All 15 hook command invocations in settings.json rewritten to use $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR prefix. Root cause: relative paths (python .claude/hooks/X.py) failed when CWD drifted outside repo root during case-study run, creating self-inflicted lockout (hooks blocked all Bash/Write/Edit, preventing their own repair). Fix applied by user from terminal (main session was deadlocked).",
      "affected_files": [
        ".claude/settings.json"
      ],
      "lesson": "Hook command paths MUST be CWD-independent. Codified as regression check 42 and rule in .claude/rules/hooks.md."
